# Root build context (the server is built from repo root so the Dockerfile can read .git for the deploy
# SHA). Keep the context lean: only apps/server + .git are needed; exclude everything heavy/irrelevant.
# .git is intentionally NOT excluded — the build reads it for the version SHA.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.next
**/.vercel
apps/web
.claude
*.md
